OL,5,G2100 Clint Eastwood: A Life In Film
OL,6,     FClint Eastwood, the actor and
OL,7,     FAcademy Award-winning director of
OL,8,     Ffilms including Unforgiven and
OL,9,     FMillion Dollar Baby, talks
